+- Only managers may freeze a project (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`). Freezing sets every member's role to `viewer`, managers included, so nobody can change the project's tasks afterwards. Membership is not removed, and there is no unfreeze endpoint. Freezing counts as a write, so an archived project returns 409.
